 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-A",
  "date": "2026-10-29",
  "draft_py": "_per_forest = QBin(\n    op=QBinOp.MUL,\n    left=QConst(value=1),\n    right=QCount(selector=Selector(\n        count=QUnbounded(),\n        mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n        filter=FAnd(children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.SUBTYPE_EQ, string_value='Forest'),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Land'),\n        )),\n        zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n    )),\n)\naura_pt = StaticAbility(\n    effect=A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n        'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=_per_forest),\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QUnbounded(),\n            mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n            filter=FAnd(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            )),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n        'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=_per_forest),\n    }),\n)\nabilities = [aura_pt, SpellAbility(kind=SpellKind.ENCHANTMENT)]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Enchant creature",
    "ir": "keywords[0] (compiled ENCHANT); abilities[1] is the enchantment cast carrier"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Forest you control.",
    "ir": "abilities[0] (StaticAbility MODIFY_PT, magnitude QBin(MUL, 1, QCount(ALL FAnd(CONTROLLER_IS YOU, SUBTYPE_EQ Forest, TYPE_EQ Land))) on ALL FAnd(IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE, TYPE_EQ Creature); Malefic Scythe / Feral Invocation shapes)"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "ENGINE ISSUES (not mapping): (1) the per-Forest count is frozen when the static first materializes (layers._materialize_static skips targets that already have a ledger entry): self-test pack mapper_A/blanchwood/pack_landdrop.json expects 5/5 after a third Forest, engine gives 4/4. (2) With the effect-less SpellAbility carrier the enchant slot falls back to ANY permanent (query.aura_enchant_slot reads only the SpellAbility effect; KeywordAbility(ENCHANT) carries no filter), so 'Enchant creature' offers artifacts, enchantments and lands. Hold until both are fixed."
 },
